  "description": "Noah, who was lucky enough to get hired at a large company, has a modest goal of working there for a long time without any problems. However, his dream is put to shame when he gets drunk and gets into an accident with his boss. And even with the strict and scary Seo Jae-Hyun, who threatens to fire him if he gets caught! Noah wants to pretend it never happened, but he's scared of getting caught by the manager, so he makes things worse with a tearful lie... \n\n*\"We... decided to start dating yesterday!!!!!!!!!\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
